---
import MobilePageHeading from '../../components/MobilePageHeading.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import {withBase} from '../../lib/urls';
---
<BaseLayout title="Christmas Fayre design options" description="Compare sign-up treatments and winter hero design concepts." noindex={true}>
<section class="site-width options"><p class="eyebrow">For discussion</p><MobilePageHeading><h1>Christmas Fayre design options</h1></MobilePageHeading><p>Compare the ways parents could sign up to help, plus a first Narnia-inspired hero concept. Nothing here has replaced the live website.</p>
<h2>Sign-up options</h2><p>Each option keeps the same event information. The homepage has a Sign up to help link to the Fayre page.</p>
<div class="choices">
<article><h3>A. Simple embed</h3><p>The live JustSignup form inside the Fayre page, with minimal framing. The whole board makes a long page.</p><a class="button" href={withBase('/preview/signup-a/')+'#sign-up'}>View option A</a></article>
<article><h3>B. Framed embed</h3><p>The same live board in a panel with an introduction and a separate-page fallback. The board keeps its own light theme.</p><a class="button" href={withBase('/preview/signup-b/')+'#sign-up'}>View option B</a></article>
<article><h3>C. Link only</h3><p>A clear button takes parents to JustSignup in a new tab. The Fayre page stays short and fast.</p><a class="button" href={withBase('/preview/signup-c/')+'#sign-up'}>View option C</a></article>
</div>
<p>Both embed previews ask you to load the third-party form. Privacy and consent handling still needs review. The form is live: please do not submit test sign-ups.</p>
<p><a class="text-link" href={withBase('/')}>See the shared homepage link</a></p>
<p><a class="button" href={withBase("/preview/signup-loaded/")+"#sign-up"}>View the board already loaded</a></p>
<h2>Narnia-inspired hero concept</h2><p>An original winter illustration with a wardrobe, snowy trees and a warm lamppost, rather than film imagery. First design, not ready for release.</p><p><a class="button" href={withBase('/preview/narnia-home/')}>Homepage concept</a> <a class="button" href={withBase('/preview/narnia-fayre/')}>Fayre page concept</a></p>
<p>Use the site's day/night control to compare themes. Phone layouts and enlarged text are part of the design review.</p></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.options{padding-block:3rem}.options h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,4rem);max-width:18ch}.options>p{max-width:70ch}.choices{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,17rem),1fr));gap:1.5rem;margin-block:2rem}.choices article{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:1rem;padding:1.5rem}.choices h3{font-size:1.5rem}.options .button{margin:.4rem .4rem .4rem 0}</style>
